{"id":"en_reunion-blood-over-lies","title":"Reunion: Blood Over Lies","titleEn":"Reunion: Blood Over Lies","description":"Sold off in childhood by her gambling-addicted father, Calvin Mercer, Anna Mercer grew up while her birth mother, Martha Hale, lost her sanity. As an adult, Anna sets out to find Martha, but is misled into believing Calvin's second wife, Brenda Mercer, is her real mother. Brenda's cruelty eventually jolts Martha back to reason. To drag Martha back to the village and silence her permanently, Brenda and Calvin threaten to sell Anna once more, all while scheming to seize the family fortune. Ethan Whitaker uncovers the truth through a DNA test. He catches the pair abducting Martha but is knocked unconscious. Anna shows up and wrongly accuses Martha. Ethan regains consciousness in time and reveals what really happened. The wrongdoers face punishment, and Anna is at last reunited with Martha.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/reunion-blood-over-lies/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/reunion-blood-over-lies/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Playing Dumb","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7deupa/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_reunion-blood-over-lies_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7deupa/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_reunion-blood-over-lies_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7deupa/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_reunion-blood-over-lies_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7deupa/